Subject: [PATCH 07/10] =?UTF-8?q?feat(faltantes):=20avisar=20faltantes=20d?=
 =?UTF-8?q?esde=20el=20cat=C3=A1logo,=20con=20o=20sin=20conexi=C3=B3n=20(R?=
